cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "RF Signal Spectrum Classification using Lightweight CNN"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Vinh Huy"
    family-names: "Giang"
    affiliation: "Ho Chi Minh City University of Technology and Education (HCMUTE)"
abstract: >
  A high-performance deep learning system for automatic identification of
  Radio Frequency (RF) signals from spectrograms. Achieves 91.83% validation
  accuracy with only 89,196 parameters, optimized for Edge AI and TinyML
  applications.
keywords:
  - deep learning
  - radar signal classification
  - RF signal
  - lightweight CNN
  - edge AI
  - TinyML
  - coordinate attention
  - spectrogram
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/vinhhuy15/Radar-Signal-Classification-DL"
